{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "496a2370-1dc6-87cf-9019-def9d467ea2a",
  "created_at": "2026-01-09T15:22:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Holly Burdick",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T15:20:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T15:20:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, this is Holly Burdick. So I just got back from walking to the mailbox, the wind is already picking up out there with this storm coming in, and anyway, that's what made me think to call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T15:21:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, what's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T15:21:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The sidewalk on my block has heaved up, one of the slabs is sticking up maybe two inches, and I tripped on it this morning. I didn't fall, but I caught my toe pretty good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T15:21:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Glad you're okay. Where is that, exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T15:21:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right in front of 193 Marsh Street, down in the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T15:21:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 193 Marsh. Anything else along that stretch?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T15:21:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the road there is pretty rough too. I hit a bad dip last week and I think it threw my alignment off. Does the city reimburse for car damage like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T15:21:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a claim process for that. I can't say how it'd turn out, but I can have someone send you the claim information. Do you want that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T15:21:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Could you also add Marsh Street to the repair list?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T15:21:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request for the sidewalk and the road both. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T15:21:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T15:22:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thanks, Holly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T15:22:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, I'm kind of rushing because I'm in the middle of teaching myself to cut hair from videos, and my roommate's waiting with a towel on his shoulders."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T15:22:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good luck with that. Someone will be in touch. Stay safe in the storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T15:22:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, you too. Bye."
    }
  ],
